### [Positive][Vehicles] Drivetrain PHEV (201 expected)
# @name phev
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/customers/{{owner.id}}/vehicles
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "licensePlate": "CP-{{Digits}}", "vin": "{{Vin}}0905", "brand": "Kia", "model": "Ceed", "year": 2022, "mileageKm": 9000, "enginePowerKw": 104, "drivetrainType": "PHEV" }

?? status == 201
